cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bee Around, please cite it as below."
title: "Bee Around"
abstract: >-
  Bee Around turns GBIF-mediated biodiversity records into playful, shareable
  posters of places. It builds a bento-style poster for a city or country from
  compact GBIF facet queries, covering species, seasonality, evidence types,
  conservation signals and data sources, with a QR-backed share link that
  reopens the same generated state.
type: software
authors:
